From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Realer Mason <stone-mason@dr.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 22:03:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] rust: add dmaengine module and DMA barriers for serial
 DMA

Register the `dmaengine` module (compiled when DMA_ENGINE is built in),
make the `serial` module depend on it, include dmaengine.h in the
bindings and the dmaengine C helper file, and add dma_wmb()/dma_rmb()
helpers plus their Rust wrappers so coherent buffer ownership transfers
are ordered from Rust.

[atk-dlrk3588-bsp] Glue from AnlangA/linux commit
44268fd8bbeb874cea782248f8384bb3c28f4419. The new files of that commit
(rust/kernel/dmaengine.rs, rust/kernel/serial/dma.rs,
rust/kernel/serial/dma/state.rs, rust/helpers/dmaengine.c) are provided
by linux/overlay/.
---
 rust/bindings/bindings_helper.h |  1 +
 rust/helpers/barrier.c          | 10 ++++++++++
 rust/helpers/helpers.c          |  1 +
 rust/kernel/lib.rs              |  4 +++-
 rust/kernel/sync/barrier.rs     | 14 ++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 29 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

